Association StaffSchoolAssociation
    documentation 'This association indicates the School(s) to which a staff member provides 
	'instructional services.
    domain entity Staff
        documentation 'The Staff member providing services to the School.
    domain entity School
        documentation 'The School where the Staff member provides services.
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation 'Identifier for a school year.
        is optional
    descriptor ProgramAssignment
        documentation 'The name of the program for which the individual is assigned; for example:
        '
        'Regular education
        '
        'Title I-Academic
        '
        'Title I-Non-Academic
        '
        'Special Education
        '
        'Bilingual/English as a Second Language.
        is part of identity
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation 'The set of grade levels for which the individual's assignment is responsible.
        is optional collection
    descriptor AcademicSubject
        documentation 'The teaching field taught by an individual, for example English/Language Arts, 
        'Reading, Mathematics, Science, Social Sciences, etc.
        is optional collection

